async function downloadPDF(){if(!state.result||!state.lastPayload){notify(t('pdfStale'),'error');return;}if(state.pdfBusy)return;const request=state.requestSequence,view=state.resultView,language=state.lang,payload={...state.lastPayload,language};state.pdfBusy=true;const button=$('#download-pdf');if(button){button.disabled=true;button.textContent=t('preparingPDF');}try{const response=await fetch('/api/report/pdf',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(payload)});if(!response.ok){let data={};try{data=await response.json();}catch(_){}throw new Error(data.error?localizeServerError(data.error,data):t('pdfError'));}const blob=await response.blob();if(!response.headers.get('content-type')?.includes('application/pdf')||blob.size<5)throw new Error(t('pdfError'));if(request!==state.requestSequence||language!==state.lang||!state.lastPayload)return;const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),link=el('a',{href:url,download:`Vedika-${view}-${payload.as_of}.pdf`});document.body.append(link);link.click();link.remove();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);}catch(error){if(request===state.requestSequence)notify(error.message||t('pdfError'),'error');}finally{if(request===state.requestSequence){state.pdfBusy=false;const current=$('#download-pdf');if(current){current.disabled=false;current.textContent=t('downloadPDF');}}}}
